{"id":"krach","lemma":"Krach","pos":"noun","rank":3326,"glosses":["crash","loud noise, ruckus","trouble, quarrel, fight (angry disagreement, especially with someone one already has a close connection to)"],"ipa":"/kʁax/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-Krach.ogg/De-Krach.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Kraches","plural":"Kräche"},"examples":[{"text":"Was war dieser Krach?","en":"What was that noise?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Unsere Nachbarn machen viel Krach.","en":"Our neighbors make a lot of noise.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"neighbour","l":"Nachbar"},{"g":"to make"},{"g":"much, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Wer macht da so einen Krach?","en":"Who's making that racket?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Kannst du den Krach aushalten?","en":"Can you put up with the noise?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to stand"}]},{"text":"Der Junge fing an, Krach zu machen.","en":"The boy began to make noise.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boy"},{"g":"to catch","l":"fangen"},{"g":"at / on"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to make"}]}]}